##### Joint Path F-Net State-Transition RNN #####
##### Joint path: [(x_{t-12}, m_{t-12}), ..., (x_{t-1}, m_{t-1})] -> h_xm,t #####
##### Forecast head: h_xm,t -> xr_t #####
##### Auxiliary state head: h_xm,t -> x_hat_t #####
##### Two settings:
##### (1) single_no_val
##### (2) avg_val


